WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.630
Log Kapten, Stardate 41601.3

2
00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.300
Kami melintasi sektor Zed Lapis

3
00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.969
Di mana kita akan berkencan dengan Shuttlecraft 13

4
00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.535
